Port doca-omp-service (ref and mpi) from the DOCA 2.0 Comm Channel API to
DOCA >= 3.0 Comch (Comm Channel was removed in DOCA 3.x).

* send/recv go through odos_comch.h (copied in by apply_patches.sh)
* a host that disconnects ends the session; main() then re-initialises and
  waits for the next host (it used to spin in recvfrom forever)
* DPU representor: odos_comch_open_rep() (rep[0] is now the uplink); the
  representor is closed on teardown
* CMake: minimum 3.10 (CMake 4 rejects 3.0); armclang stays the default but
  -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER now overrides it; link libdoca_comch

Against usman0xff/doca-omp-service 655b3b555abc7800d336f6eb9f4aaf5335552eaf.

